    <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="f-358" contextRef="c-09">&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 54pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -36pt; line-height: normal; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 25.82pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 54pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -36pt; line-height: normal; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 25.82pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 54pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -36pt; line-height: normal; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;3.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 25.82pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 54pt; margin-bottom: 0; text-indent: -36pt; line-height: normal; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;4.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 25.82pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;None&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-left: 54pt; margin-bottom: 14pt; text-indent: -36pt; line-height: normal; font-size: 12pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;5.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="width: 25.82pt; font: 7pt &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;; display: inline-block"&gt;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Tahoma"&gt;N/A&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 		&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
    <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-360" contextRef="c-09">&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0; font-size: 11pt"&gt;&lt;span style="font-weight: bold; background-color: unset; font-size: 1em; text-align: inherit"&gt;The Company&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class="Section_1"&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Enterprise Interstate Crude LLC (the &amp;quot;Company&amp;quot;) is an indirect wholly owned subsidiary of Enterprise Products Operating LLC, a Texas limited liability company (&amp;quot;EPOLLC&amp;quot;). EPOLLC in turn is wholly owned by Enterprise Products Partners L.P., a Delaware limited partnership, which is a publicly traded partnership. Enterprise Crude Pipeline LLC (&amp;quot;ECPL&amp;quot;) serves as operator of the Company. As operator, ECPL provides operating, administrative, marketing, construction, and other services related to the business and affairs of the Company.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Description of the Property&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company's assets include approximately 1,100-miles of pipeline comprised of the Company's 100% ownership interest in the West Texas System. In addition, the Company has an approximate 13% undivided joint ownership interest in Basin Pipeline (&amp;quot;Basin&amp;quot;) which is operated by Plains All American Pipeline, L.P. and is approximately 600 miles in length.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The West Texas System connects West Texas and Southeast New Mexico to the Midland, Texas terminal. Basin extends from the Permian Basin (New Mexico and Texas) to Cushing, Oklahoma.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Basis of Accounting&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The accounting policies followed in preparation of these financial statements conform to those required by FERC. Financial statements are prepared on the accrual basis of accounting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt; Property, plant and equipment assets are recorded at original cost.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Revenue Recognition&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;Revenues are primarily derived from transportation of crude oil under intrastate and interstate tariffs. The tariffs specify the amounts to be paid by shippers for service between receipt and delivery locations and the general terms and conditions of transportation services on the pipeline system. Revenues are recognized upon delivery of product to its shippers.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Income Taxes&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company is a limited liability company that passes income tax liability through the company to EPOLLC and, with the exception of the Texas Franchise Tax, if applicable, does not recognize this liability on the Company's financial statements. For purposes of calculating income taxes for the annual cost of service (shown on page 700 of the Annual Report), the Company employs FERC's Policy Statement on Income Tax Allowances.&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span style="font-weight: bold"&gt;Employees&lt;/span&gt; 			&lt;/p&gt; 			&lt;p style="margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 8pt"&gt; 				&lt;span&gt;The Company does not have any employees. All of the Company management, administrative and operating functions are performed by employees of Enterprise Products Company on behalf of ECPL. The Company reimburses ECPL for the allocated costs of Enterprise Products Company employees who perform operating, management and other administrative functions for the Company under the terms of an operating agreement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; 		&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
